173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E ("Over the course of this academic module, our group set out to build an end-to-end web platform capable of reshaping how audience members interact with media reviews and title selection. Today, we are proud to guide you through the features, design philosophy, and technical architecture of Starfilmseries." )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
174 0 obj
<<
