198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E ("From a software design standpoint, our objective was to construct an immersive, cinema-inspired Design System. We combined deep slate backgrounds with high-contrast accent colors, crisp typography, and full-bleed poster imagery to craft an aesthetically )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E ("As users scroll past the highlights, they enter our dedicated content hubs, which are strictly divided into Feature Films and Television Series to maintain logical domain separation." )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E ("In our Film Collection, we showcase iconic works ranging from modern sci-fi classics like Blade Runner 2049 to high-octane action masterpieces like John Wick 4 and epic storytelling like The Lord of the Rings and The Dark Knight." )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E ("In our TV Series section, we curated landmark television productions such as Stranger Things, The Last of Us, Game of Thrones, and Chernobyl. Each entry is housed inside responsive UI cards that feature subtle micro-interactions upon hover, creating a feeling of fluid interactivity." )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E ("To complement linear browsing, we developed a dynamic Genre Navigation System. Understanding that mood dictates viewing preferences, users can filter the entire repository by genres such as Science Fiction, Action, Fantasy, Drama, and Thriller with a single tap." )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E ("Furthermore, we implemented a dedicated Ranking Engine. This feature collects and synthesizes rating scores across the database, ordering titles sequentially based on popularity and quality benchmarks." )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E ("The Ranking Section serves as a trusted guide for enthusiasts who want to bypass discovery and head straight to top-tier, highly-rated cinematic masterpieces." )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
